        (N'AE-01-P05A', N'WF-X-PIPE-01', N'AE-PIPE-1', N'PH-AE-PIPE-1-EXPL', 4, N'Receive pushed business-metric changes', N'Subscribe to a relevant MSXI report or business topic', N'Extended', N'Activity', NULL, N'1. Open Proactive Insights in MSXI.
